# Access key for the contact form, from https://web3forms.com (free — sign up
# with your email to get one). This key is public-by-design per Web3Forms:
# it only identifies which inbox submissions get emailed to, and is meant to
# be bundled into client-side JS. Still, never put an actual secret/API
# token in a VITE_* variable — those are always visible in page source.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the value, then restart `npm run dev`.
# If you deploy this site, also add this variable in your hosting platform's
# environment-variable settings — .env.local is gitignored and won't ship.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
